{
  "name": "AI Lead Platform",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an expert inbound lead qualification and scoring assistant for an enterprise agency.\nYour task is to analyze the prospect's submission, score their business fit, and return the result STRICTLY as a valid JSON object. \nDO NOT include any markdown code blocks (no ```json or ```), explanations, or preamble. Return RAW JSON only.\n\n---\nPROSPECT DATA:\n- Full Name: {{ $json.clientName }}\n- Email: {{ $json.cleanEmail }}\n- Link Provided: {{ $json.hasLink }}\n- Website / Profile URL: {{ $json.targetUrl }}\n- Scraped / Source Content: {{ $json.hasLink && $json.data ? $json.data.toString().slice(0, 3500) : 'No external link provided or site is unreachable' }}\n- Extract the prospect's brand or organization name into \"company_name\" based on the scraped content, meta tags, or domain. If it's a personal inquiry with no company, output \"Individual\".\n\n---\nSCORING CRITERIA (score from 0 to 100):\n1. Direct Inbound (No Link): If no website is provided, but valid email and name are present, treat as a warm inbound inquiry. Score between 65 and 75. Category: \"DIRECT_INBOUND\".\n2. B2B / Commercial Fit: If content demonstrates an active business, SaaS, agency, or verified tech project, score between 80 and 95. Category: \"B2B_QUALIFIED\".\n3. Low Fit / Spam: If data contains gibberish, throwaway email domains, or malicious intent, score below 40. Category: \"SPAM_OR_LOW_FIT\".\n\n---\nREQUIRED JSON OUTPUT SCHEMA:\n{\n  \"score\": 85,\n  \"fit_status\": \"HIGH\",\n  \"category\": \"B2B_QUALIFIED\",\n  \"key_insight\": \"Concise 1-2 sentence executive summary of the lead profile.\",\n  \"recommended_angle\": \"Actionable hook or topic to mention during discovery\",\n  \"company_name\": \"Extracted business or organization name (or 'Individual / Unknown' if not found)\",\n}",
        "batching": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.9,
      "position": [
        672,
        0
      ],
      "id": "95481692-b3cd-4323-8d5f-23a19d444b03",
      "name": "Basic LLM Chain"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": "inclusionai/ling-3.0-flash-vl",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenRouter",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        736,
        160
      ],
      "id": "16587340-62c3-4d1f-8e03-7de35fd87798",
      "name": "OpenRouter Chat Model"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const output = [];\n\nfor (const item of $input.all()) {\n  // ответ первой модели\n  const rawText = (item.json.text || '').trim();\n\n  // убираем обёртку ```json\n  const cleaned = rawText\n    .replace(/^```json\\s*/i, '')\n    .replace(/^```\\s*/i, '')\n    .replace(/```$/i, '')\n    .trim();\n\n  let parsed = {};\n  try {\n    parsed = JSON.parse(cleaned);\n  } catch (error) {\n    // если модель вернула не JSON\n    parsed = {\n      score: 50,\n      fit_status: 'REVIEW',\n      category: 'PARSE_FALLBACK',\n      key_insight: rawText || 'Не удалось разобрать JSON ответа модели',\n      recommended_angle: 'Требуется ручная проверка контакта'\n    };\n  }\n\n  // данные лида + оценка\n  output.push({\n    json: {\n      ...item.json,\n      ...parsed,\n      // score должен быть числом для узла If\n      score: Number(parsed.score) || 0\n    }\n  });\n}\n\nreturn output;"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1024,
