    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a senior Business Development Representative (BDR).\nCraft a concise, hyper-personalized first touch email draft to a qualified inbound prospect based on their profile assessment.\n\n---\nLEAD CONTEXT:\n- Name: {{ $json.clientName }}\n- Email: {{ $json.cleanEmail }}\n- Category: {{ $json.category }}\n- Fit Score: {{ $json.score }}/100\n- AI Summary: {{ $json.key_insight }}\n- Strategic Hook: {{ $json.recommended_angle }}\n\n---\nGUIDELINES:\n1. Length: Exactly 3 to 4 punchy sentences. No fluff, no generic opening phrases (never use \"I hope this email finds you well\").\n2. Contextual Hook: Address the prospect by their first name and seamlessly integrate the specific insight from \"Strategic Hook\".\n3. Clear Call to Action (CTA): Propose a low-friction next step (e.g., an intro call or a brief clarifying question).\n4. Output format: Return ONLY the message body. Do not include subject lines, meta-notes, or placeholder brackets.",
        "batching": {}
      },
